    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "nina",
        "speaker": "Nina",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 132,
        "text": "We need to prepare the school hall for a small concert. The supervisor asked us to inspect the space before the guests arrive.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3cdedfa59d1e11ac496901283b8264f91ee015ad15f0536cba5d86b2210ce1a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 138,
        "sourceEnd": 253,
        "text": "I can see a safety problem near the side exit. Someone left a heavy box in the doorway. It could block the way out.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4825609f949b24a749f2fbff41d640989c1242e1ba63918971458ee566443f7e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nina",
        "speaker": "Nina",
        "sourceStart": 260,
        "sourceEnd": 383,
        "text": "Let us move it together. I will push from this side while you guide the other end. Please tell me if you lose your balance.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "54d8ae3e27e32e97a86d2d5737d4df76cbf5ddd67ad9859184b4b7cb6ede5646",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 389,
        "sourceEnd": 475,
        "text": "All right. The path is clear now. We should also avoid placing the box near the alarm.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "db4b4fe9add154a6fe8dbc1dbe18a6601c0fd26b8f1110f5a8b0ef54dea0c15b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nina",
        "speaker": "Nina",
        "sourceStart": 482,
        "sourceEnd": 633,
        "text": "I found a spill beside the stage. The floor may be slippery, so I will put a barrier around it. Can you give the others a signal to use the other door?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "be61114c14544379e854923aef9822dfff3f31cec0f5f29d19bbfa47a2829008",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 639,
        "sourceEnd": 773,
        "text": "Yes. I will raise my hand and explain the danger. The cleaner says the spill is only water from a bottle. She has a cloth and a glove.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "209dbd717997c4d9c932d42c09a6559854f59d6b28ec0b344d1366afdd372766",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nina",
        "speaker": "Nina",
        "sourceStart": 780,
        "sourceEnd": 883,
        "text": "Good. We should not touch anything we cannot identify. The staff member can decide how to deal with it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "07da5a0c66ad9ed222c28888141463d12b03ca393ddb53962cdbcdcee262f6b9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 889,
        "sourceEnd": 1058,
        "text": "There is also a ladder near the wall. I was carrying a chair when I saw it. It is not in the way, but someone could fall if they leave it open in the middle of the room.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "39bf3fe9ce1196f1f4990a3e3b978a221a42e782a92d55f37bddcfa614f4490b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nina",
        "speaker": "Nina",
        "sourceStart": 1065,
        "sourceEnd": 1210,
        "text": "I will ask the supervisor where it belongs. We can prevent an accident by putting it away. Do not try to pull it while you are holding the chair.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cae99cfec67016f05ec26a7505f344495c47dac26c67608622b1fd91b5eb1eb3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1216,
        "sourceEnd": 1318,
        "text": "My shoulder is fine, but the chair is awkward. I will set it down first to reduce the risk to my back.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9f0eca4ca19f99a88a1187738db891e8a552eee9db9e856c471ac339d9b4d451",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nina",
        "speaker": "Nina",
        "sourceStart": 1325,
        "sourceEnd": 1430,
        "text": "Thanks. The music group arrives at four, and the doors open at five. Let us finish the check before four.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1b9c3dfcd6a273786e6f01e35366363aea1c90ac4ad66c04f15a7651541277fa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1436,
        "sourceEnd": 1531,
        "text": "We have time. Let's follow the hall's safety checklist and ask the supervisor if we are unsure.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ddda4f683318499086aa9966228a5256aed733ae76012069e25531d93ceba355",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
